{"architectures":["x64","x86"],"id":"4gray.iptvnator","latestVersion":"0.24.0","media":{"icons":[],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"description":"A video player application that provides support for the playback of IPTV playlists (m3u, m3u8).","license":"MIT","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/4gray/iptvnator/blob/HEAD/LICENSE.md","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"description":"A video player application that provides support for the playback of IPTV playlists (m3u, m3u8).","license":"MIT","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/4gray/iptvnator/blob/HEAD/LICENSE.md","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"IPTVnator is a video player application that provides support for IPTV playlist playback (m3u, m3u8). The application allows users to import playlists using remote URLs or by uploading files from the local file system. Additionally, it supports EPG information in XMLTV format which can be provided via URL.\nThe application is a cross-platform, open-source project built with Electron and Angular.\n⚠️ Note: IPTVnator does not provide any playlists or other digital content. The channels and pictures in the screenshots are for demonstration purposes only.","name":"IPTVnator","packageUrl":"https://github.com/4gray/iptvnator","publisher":"4gray","publisherUrl":"https://4gray.dev/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/4gray/iptvnator/releases/tag/v0.24.0","tags":["epg","iptv","iptv-player","m3u","m3u8","player","playlist","video"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"一款支持播放 IPTV 播放列表（m3u、m3u8）的视频播放器应用程序。","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"IPTVnator 是一款支持 IPTV 播放列表播放（m3u、m3u8）的视频播放器应用程序。用户可通过远程 URL 或从本地文件系统上传文件的方式导入播放列表。此外，该应用还支持以 XMLTV 格式提供的 EPG 信息，并可通过 URL 加载。\n该应用是一个基于 Electron 和 Angular 构建的跨平台开源项目。\n⚠️ 注意：IPTVnator 不提供任何播放列表或其他数字内容。截图中的频道和图片仅用于演示目的。","tags":["iptv","iptv播放器","m3u","m3u8","播放列表","播放器","电子节目指南","视频","网络电视"]}},"longDescription":"IPTVnator is a video player application that provides support for IPTV playlist playback (m3u, m3u8). The application allows users to import playlists using remote URLs or by uploading files from the local file system. Additionally, it supports EPG information in XMLTV format which can be provided via URL.\nThe application is a cross-platform, open-source project built with Electron and Angular.\n⚠️ Note: IPTVnator does not provide any playlists or other digital content. The channels and pictures in the screenshots are for demonstration purposes only.","name":"IPTVnator","packageUrl":"https://github.com/4gray/iptvnator","publisher":"4gray","publisherUrl":"https://4gray.dev/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/4gray/iptvnator/releases/tag/v0.24.0","tags":["epg","iptv","iptv-player","m3u","m3u8","player","playlist","video"]},"schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","versions":[{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/0.24.0/app.json","detailSha256":"bfc0eb99030963b2fc7ee50be0748f2d81dcad9d30252d5d334988c9d3a037e4","releaseDate":"2026-09-24","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"0.24.0"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/0.23.0/app.json","detailSha256":"44413b23f8fa82e8ae550fa751964930e7b770b272e49ce17f3ada1c41072e27","releaseDate":"2026-08-30","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"0.23.0"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/0.22.0/app.json","detailSha256":"2ecf01b3e367e1421088f63744a209f976abca17d46727cc3774738e830c6a16","releaseDate":"2026-07-05","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"0.22.0"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/0.21.0/app.json","detailSha256":"f18b2077bb7542573de0717cf76d02e1bd53c5274135d272e8ef19f0d7c59e32","releaseDate":"2026-05-06","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"0.21.0"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/0.20.0/app.json","detailSha256":"505ecd81d0d48fdec88818fe451e6103a7469a83f0238874fc8e372500faa109","releaseDate":"2026-04-26","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"0.20.0"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/0.19.0/app.json","detailSha256":"698f2863e44e638f6150fd5f2903c402128425000892a35474d